<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1833317225"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1583690184"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="アイノシズク"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KARAKURI 2039"/><amll:meta key="album" value="It's A Perfect Blue"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:25.456"><div begin="00:20.274" end="03:55.289"><p begin="00:20.274" end="00:24.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">物憂げな冬の惑星(ほし)で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冬季的行星之上 万物萧瑟一片苍凉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no u ge na fu yu no ho shi de</span></p><p begin="00:25.074" end="00:29.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">靴下も持たず生まれたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赤脚的我诞生于此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku tsu shi ta mo mo ta zu u ma re ta yo</span></p><p begin="00:29.977" end="00:33.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">寒空に僕ら凍えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在天寒地冻之中冻僵的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa mu zo ra ni bo ku ra ko go e te</span></p><p begin="00:34.155" end="00:38.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">少し痩せたまあるいイノチ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原本蓬勃滋润的生命 也变得稍显消瘦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi ya se ta ma a ru i i no chi</span></p><p begin="00:39.525" end="00:41.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">ここがどこかわからないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知自己身处何处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ga do ko ka wa ka ra na i de</span></p><p begin="00:41.565" end="00:43.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">手を伸ばしたりとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸出双手四处探寻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo no ba shi ta ri to ka</span></p><p begin="00:44.385" end="00:46.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">いつもなぜか恥ずかしくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总觉莫名有些羞愧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo na ze ka ha zu ka shi ku te</span></p><p begin="00:46.430" end="00:48.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">これといって訳もなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 也没有什么原因</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re to i 't te wa ke mo na ku te</span></p><p begin="00:49.264" end="00:51.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">そんな日々が難しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许只是由于艰难度日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na hi bi ga mu zu ka shi ku te</span></p><p begin="00:51.369" end="00:53.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">立ち止まっているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令我疲惫不堪 停滞不前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta chi do ma 't te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:53.757" end="00:56.087" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">ここだよって声枯らして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声嘶力竭大声呼喊着“我在这里”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko da yo 't te ko e ka ra shi te</span></p><p begin="00:56.316" end="00:57.989" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">誰かを呼ぶんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛是在呼唤着谁一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka wo yo bu n da</span></p><p begin="00:58.432" end="01:02.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">正しくありたいと胸を焦がす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望踏上正途 内心却无比煎熬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi ku a ri ta i to mu ne wo ko ga su</span></p><p begin="01:03.494" end="01:07.756" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">されど知る あれない自分<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽说我也明白 不能胡乱荒废自我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa re do shi ru a re na i ji bu n</span></p><p begin="01:08.049" end="01:12.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">それでもあなたの頬を落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 那从你脸颊上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo a na ta no ho ho wo o chi ru</span></p><p begin="01:13.134" end="01:17.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">シズクだけが僕の理由<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滑落的泪珠 仍是我唯一的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu ku da ke ga bo ku no ri yu u</span></p><p begin="01:22.883" end="01:24.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Darling I for U<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Darling I for U</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Darling I for U</span></p><p begin="01:25.319" end="01:27.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ただ愛してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是纯粹地爱着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da a i shi te ru</span></p><p begin="01:32.502" end="01:34.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Darling I need U<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Darling I need U</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Darling I need U</span></p><p begin="01:34.987" end="01:36.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">夜を越える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨越无尽黑夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru wo ko e ru</span></p><p begin="01:40.115" end="01:44.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">朧(おぼろ)げな夢のスキマ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦境与现实的罅隙 如此虚幻朦胧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo ro ge na yu me no su ki ma</span></p><p begin="01:45.089" end="01:49.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">いつかみた光探すけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 我会去探寻那透过缝隙的一缕光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka mi ta hi ka ri sa ga su ke do</span></p><p begin="01:49.746" end="01:53.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">あなたがくれた僕の答えは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你给予我的 我所寻觅的答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga ku re ta bo ku no ko ta e ha</span></p><p begin="01:54.114" end="01:58.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">消えることなく触れたイノリ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如即使触碰也永不会消逝的祈愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e ru ko to na ku fu re ta i no ri</span></p><p begin="01:59.612" end="02:01.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">たぶんそれは見えないだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许那是仅凭肉眼无法感知的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta bu n so re ha mi e na i da ke</span></p><p begin="02:01.607" end="02:03.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">でも廻り始めた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但它已经开始循环轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo ma wa ri ha ji me ta</span></p><p begin="02:04.383" end="02:06.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">いつかそこに辿り着いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终究会历经艰险到达终点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka so ko ni ta do ri tsu i te</span></p><p begin="02:06.393" end="02:08.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">触れた指 冷たいね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你触碰我的手指 有些冰凉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta yu bi tsu me ta i ne</span></p><p begin="02:09.216" end="02:11.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">そんな日々を願ったまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样祈愿着曾经的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na hi bi wo ne ga 't ta ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:11.363" end="02:13.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">飛び立てずいるなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是无法展翅翱翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ta te zu i ru na ra</span></p><p begin="02:13.734" end="02:14.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">どこへだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论前往何处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko he da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:14.874" end="02:16.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">そこへだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是前往那个地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko he da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:16.305" end="02:18.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">今すぐ行くから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">立刻出发吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma su gu i ku ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:18.344" end="02:22.863" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">優しくなりたいと胸が痛む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要变得温柔 心头便阵阵刺痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi ku na ri ta i to mu ne ga i ta mu</span></p><p begin="02:23.467" end="02:27.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">されど知る 僕らは違う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽说我也明白 我们仍是各不相同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa re do shi ru bo ku ra ha chi ga u</span></p><p begin="02:27.950" end="02:32.554" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">それでもあなたの頬を撫でる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 此刻我正用双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo a na ta no ho ho wo na de ru</span></p><p begin="02:33.206" end="02:37.171" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">両手はいま僕の自由<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻抚你的脸颊 这仍是我当下的自由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ryo u te ha i ma bo ku no ji yu u</span></p><p begin="02:42.831" end="02:44.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Darling I for U<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Darling I for U</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Darling I for U</span></p><p begin="02:45.302" end="02:47.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">いま愛してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻仍深爱着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma a i shi te ru</span></p><p begin="02:52.482" end="02:54.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Darling I need U<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Darling I need U</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Darling I need U</span></p><p begin="02:55.026" end="02:56.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">夜を駆ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驰骋在夜空之下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru wo ka ke ru</span></p><p begin="03:16.776" end="03:20.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">だんだん近づいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此间的距离越发接近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da n da n chi ka du i te</span></p><p begin="03:21.708" end="03:25.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">ただ寂しくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却变得愈发寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da sa bi shi ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="03:26.488" end="03:30.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">だんだんひとつになって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人渐渐化为一体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da n da n hi to tsu ni na 't te</span></p><p begin="03:31.126" end="03:35.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">僕らきっとアイを叫ぶ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们定能尽情呼唤着爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ki 't to a i wo sa ke bu</span></p><p begin="03:40.972" end="03:42.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Darling I for U<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Darling I for U</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Darling I for U</span></p><p begin="03:43.468" end="03:45.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">ただ愛してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是纯粹地爱着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da a i shi te ru</span></p><p begin="03:50.703" end="03:52.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Darling I need U<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Darling I need U</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Darling I need U</span></p><p begin="03:53.206" end="03:55.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">夜が明ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黎明降临</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru ga a ke ru</span></p></div></body></tt>